		<defName>ZCB_Dishwasher</defName>
		<title>dishwasher</title>
		<titleShort>washer</titleShort>
		<baseDesc>[PAWN_nameDef] spent [PAWN_possessive] spare time in the kitchen. To avoid being underfoot, [PAWN_pronoun] helped wash dishes. In return, the cooks of COLONYNAME taught [PAWN_objective] the basics of food prep.</baseDesc>
